  "body_html": "<p>I’ve said it before: even though the <strong>S&amp;P 500</strong> and your beloved <strong>Mag 7</strong> look like hot garbage lately… there are <strong>tons of mid-cap stocks</strong> setting up beautifully. </p><p>And today — <strong>3 of them just broke out</strong> of long consolidations.</p><p>Not gonna drag this out. I’ll get straight to the tickers.</p><p>We’ll check back in <strong>one month</strong>. Make sure to <strong>set stops</strong> in case any of these turn into fakeouts — but based on the <strong>volume behind the breakouts</strong>, they’re looking strong for the mid-term.</p><p><span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p><p>With everyone stressed and losing jobs… don’t be surprised if <strong>more people start lighting up</strong>. 🚬👀</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8bOI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4056f4d5-7f5d-4143-9cac-dbda0939c504_1248x700.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8bOI!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4056f4d5-7f5d-4143-9cac-dbda0939c504_1248x700.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8bOI!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4056f4d5-7f5d-4143-9cac-dbda0939c504_1248x700.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8bOI!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4056f4d5-7f5d-4143-9cac-dbda0939c504_1248x700.png 1272w, htt